{"seq":3,"slug":"multi-model-provider","title":"多模型 Provider","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/ai-agent-handbook/foundations/multi-model-provider","wordCount":1066,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"多模型-provider\">多模型 Provider</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>Provider 是 AI SDK 用来隔离「模型厂商差异」的抽象层。每个 Provider 把对应厂商的 HTTP API 包装成一个统一的 <code>LanguageModel</code> 接口，Core API 只面向这个接口编程——因此切换模型只是替换一个 Provider 实例，业务代码无需改动。</p>\n<p>现实中有大量 OpenAI 兼容的模型服务（DeepSeek、豆包、GLM、Qwen、MiniMax 乃至本地的 Ollama），它们共用同一套请求/响应格式，因此不必为每家写一个独立 SDK：用 <code>createOpenAI</code> 加上各自的 <code>baseURL</code> 即可接入。差异被收敛在一处配置里，而不是散落在每个调用点。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>接入方式</th>\n<th>适用对象</th>\n<th>做法</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>原生 Provider 包</td>\n<td>OpenAI、Anthropic、Google</td>\n<td>直接 <code>import { openai } from &#39;@ai-sdk/openai&#39;</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>OpenAI 兼容模式</td>\n<td>DeepSeek、豆包、GLM、Qwen、MiniMax</td>\n<td><code>createOpenAI({ apiKey, baseURL })</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>本地模型</td>\n<td>Ollama</td>\n<td>兼容模式 + <code>http://localhost:11434/v1</code></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>两条纪律贯穿本节：API Key 一律经环境变量注入、绝不硬编码；模型 ID 通过注册表集中管理，业务层只引用稳定别名。做到这两点，模型迭代与厂商切换才不会变成全局替换的体力活。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"provider-架构\">Provider 架构</h2><p>AI SDK 的 Provider 是一个将模型 API 适配为统一接口的抽象层。每个 Provider 包装对应厂商的 HTTP API，暴露出一致的 <code>LanguageModel</code> 接口供 Core API 调用。这意味着切换模型只需替换 Provider 实例，应用代码无需任何修改。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    subgraph 应用代码&#10;        CALL[&quot;generateText({ model })&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph Provider 注册表&#10;        REG{createProvider}&#10;        REG --&gt; P1[&quot;openai(&#39;gpt-5&#39;)&quot;]&#10;        REG --&gt; P2[&quot;anthropic(&#39;claude-sonnet-4-5&#39;)&quot;]&#10;        REG --&gt; P3[&quot;deepseek(&#39;deepseek-chat&#39;)&quot;]&#10;        REG --&gt; P4[&quot;ollama(&#39;qwen3:8b&#39;)&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph 模型 API&#10;        API1[&quot;api.openai.com&quot;]&#10;        API2[&quot;api.anthropic.com&quot;]&#10;        API3[&quot;api.deepseek.com&quot;]&#10;        API4[&quot;localhost:11434&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;    CALL --&gt; REG&#10;    P1 --&gt; API1&#10;    P2 --&gt; API2&#10;    P3 --&gt; API3&#10;    P4 --&gt; API4\">graph LR\n    subgraph 应用代码\n        CALL[\"generateText({ model })\"]\n    end\n    subgraph Provider 注册表\n        REG{createProvider}\n        REG --&gt; P1[\"openai('gpt-5')\"]\n        REG --&gt; P2[\"anthropic('claude-sonnet-4-5')\"]\n        REG --&gt; P3[\"deepseek('deepseek-chat')\"]\n        REG --&gt; P4[\"ollama('qwen3:8b')\"]\n    end\n    subgraph 模型 API\n        API1[\"api.openai.com\"]\n        API2[\"api.anthropic.com\"]\n        API3[\"api.deepseek.com\"]\n        API4[\"localhost:11434\"]\n    end\n    CALL --&gt; REG\n    P1 --&gt; API1\n    P2 --&gt; API2\n    P3 --&gt; API3\n    P4 --&gt; API4</pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"环境变量配置\">环境变量配置</h2><p>所有 API Key 通过环境变量注入，绝不硬编码到代码中。创建 <code>.env</code> 文件：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"OPENAI_API_KEY=sk-xxx&#10;OPENAI_BASE_URL=https://api.openai.com/v1&#10;&#10;ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=sk-ant-xxx&#10;&#10;DEEPSEEK_API_KEY=sk-xxx&#10;DEEPSEEK_BASE_URL=https://api.deepseek.com&#10;&#10;DOUBAO_API_KEY=xxx&#10;DOUBAO_BASE_URL=https://ark.cn-beijing.volces.com/api/v3&#10;&#10;GLM_API_KEY=xxx&#10;GLM_BASE_URL=https://open.bigmodel.cn/api/paas/v4&#10;&#10;QWEN_API_KEY=sk-xxx&#10;QWEN_BASE_URL=https://dashscope.aliyuncs.com/compatible-mode/v1&#10;&#10;MINIMAX_API_KEY=xxx&#10;MINIMAX_BASE_URL=https://api.minimax.chat/v1&#10;&#10;OLLAMA_BASE_URL=http://localhost:11434/v1\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">OPENAI_API_KEY</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">sk-xxx</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">OPENAI_BASE_URL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">https://api.openai.com/v1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">ANTHROPIC_API_KEY</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">sk-ant-xxx</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">DEEPSEEK_API_KEY</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">sk-xxx</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">DEEPSEEK_BASE_URL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">https://api.deepseek.com</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">DOUBAO_API_KEY</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">xxx</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">DOUBAO_BASE_URL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">https://ark.cn-beijing.volces.com/api/v3</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">GLM_API_KEY</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">xxx</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">GLM_BASE_URL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">https://open.bigmodel.cn/api/paas/v4</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">QWEN_API_KEY</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">sk-xxx</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">QWEN_BASE_URL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">https://dashscope.aliyuncs.com/compatible-mode/v1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">MINIMAX_API_KEY</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">xxx</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">MINIMAX_BASE_URL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">https://api.minimax.chat/v1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">OLLAMA_BASE_URL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">http://localhost:11434/v1</span></span></code></pre></div><blockquote>\n<p>将 <code>.env</code> 加入 <code>.gitignore</code>，避免密钥泄漏。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"provider-安装\">Provider 安装</h2><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"pnpm add @ai-sdk/openai @ai-sdk/anthropic\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">pnpm</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> add</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> @ai-sdk/openai</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> @ai-sdk/anthropic</span></span></code></pre></div><p>对于兼容 OpenAI API 格式的国产模型（DeepSeek、豆包、GLM、Qwen、MiniMax），可直接使用 <code>@ai-sdk/openai</code> 的 <code>createOpenAI</code> 配合自定义 <code>baseURL</code>。Ollama 同理。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"逐一配置-provider\">逐一配置 Provider</h2><h3 id=\"openai\">OpenAI</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"import { openai } from &#39;@ai-sdk/openai&#39;;&#10;&#10;const model = openai(&#39;gpt-5&#39;);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { openai } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '@ai-sdk/openai'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> model</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> openai</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'gpt-5'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span></code></pre></div><p>SDK 自动读取 <code>OPENAI_API_KEY</code> 环境变量。</p>\n<h3 id=\"anthropic\">Anthropic</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"import { anthropic } from &#39;@ai-sdk/anthropic&#39;;&#10;&#10;const model = anthropic(&#39;claude-sonnet-4-5&#39;);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { anthropic } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '@ai-sdk/anthropic'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> model</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> anthropic</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'claude-sonnet-4-5'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span></code></pre></div><p>SDK 自动读取 <code>ANTHROPIC_API_KEY</code> 环境变量。</p>\n<h3 id=\"deepseek\">DeepSeek</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"import { createOpenAI } from &#39;@ai-sdk/openai&#39;;&#10;&#10;const deepseek = createOpenAI({&#10;  apiKey: process.env.DEEPSEEK_API_KEY,&#10;  baseURL: process.env.DEEPSEEK_BASE_URL,&#10;});&#10;&#10;const model = deepseek(&#39;deepseek-chat&#39;);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { createOpenAI } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '@ai-sdk/openai'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> deepseek</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> createOpenAI</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  apiKey: process.env.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">DEEPSEEK_API_KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  baseURL: process.env.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">DEEPSEEK_BASE_URL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">});</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> model</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> deepseek</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'deepseek-chat'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"豆包-doubao\">豆包 (Doubao)</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"import { createOpenAI } from &#39;@ai-sdk/openai&#39;;&#10;&#10;const doubao = createOpenAI({&#10;  apiKey: process.env.DOUBAO_API_KEY,&#10;  baseURL: process.env.DOUBAO_BASE_URL,&#10;});&#10;&#10;const model = doubao(&#39;doubao-1.5-pro-32k-250115&#39;);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {